{
  "_comment": [
    "Every column of every tw_ table and view, as the database actually has",
    "them. Generated by scripts/check-columns.mjs --write against the live",
    "project; do not hand-edit.",
    "",
    "This exists because the Now board shipped asking tw_hours for a",
    "job_location column that was not there. The build passed, and the",
    "browser test's fake database answered the query anyway, so every check",
    "was green until Jason opened the page and got",
    "  column tw_hours.job_location does not exist",
    "scripts/_fakerest.mjs checks select lists against this file, so an",
    "invented column now fails a test instead of reaching the shop."
